OL,3,GNEWSAThetford accused out of prison
OL,4,Aafter charge dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of sharing details of
OL,7,Fproperties housing asylum seekers has
OL,8,Fbeen released from prison after charges
OL,9,Fagainst him were dropped, the Ministry
OL,10,Fof Justice (MoJ) has said.
OL,12,FJames Jobson, from Costessey near
OL,13,FNorwich, had been charged and remanded
OL,14,Fin custody following anti-immigration
OL,15,Fdisorder in Thetford, but Norfolk
OL,16,FPolice said on Friday that no further
OL,17,Faction would be taken.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
