OL,3,GNEWSAThetford accused out of prison
OL,4,Aafter charge dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier on Saturday, Jobson's family
OL,7,Ftold the BBC he was "still in prison"
OL,8,Fand that they were "in bits" as they
OL,9,Fhad been informed it would be Monday
OL,10,Fbefore he was released.
OL,12,FShortly after 22:00 BST, the MoJ said
OL,13,FJobson, 62, had now been released.
